{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/wasabi/items/22901/", "pk": 22901, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/wasabi/", "pk": 713, "shortname": "wasabi", "name": "Wasabi Tours Hawaii", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Big Island Waterfalls Adventure", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 12, "unicode": "Big Island Waterfalls Adventure", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": -750, "description": "#Swim in a Private Waterfall and Visit a Tropical Garden\n\n## Duration\n\n10-11 hours\n\n## About\n\n- Visit majestic Waipio Valley Lookout to capture lush and tall cliffs that drop into the sparkling ocean\n- Walk through a rainforest and discover the towering Akaka Falls that plummets into a stream-eroded gorge\n- Explore Hawaii Tropical Bioreserve & Garden, a spectacular nature preserve with cascading waterfalls\n- Swim under the 120-feet tall Kulaniapia private waterfall surrounded by diverse flora \n- Visit the famous 80-foot Rainbow Falls in Hilo with giant banyan trees beside it\n- Traverse the scenic Saddle Road and marvel at the tallest and most massive mountains in the world\n***\nExplore Hawaii Tropical Botanical Garden, swim at Kulanipia private waterfalls, visit the majestic Waipio Valley Lookout and the stunning Akaka Falls on the Hamakua Coast of the Big Island of Hawaii on this full day of fun and exciting adventure. Discover the island’s diverse natural beauty, including multiple waterfalls, lush rain forests, and rugged sea cliffs as your guide shares history and legends.\n***\n###Tour Difficulty\nModerate hiking over short distances. Ages 5 and older are required.\n***\n### Included in the Tour\nGuests are served local-style picnic lunch with assorted juices, snacks, and bottled water. In addition, all admission fees, mosquito repellent, and rain gear.\n***\n### Pickup Locations\nWe pick up guests from all major resorts and hotels in Keauhou, Kona, Waikoloa, and Kohala Coast between 7 am to 8:30 am. Actual pickup times vary depending on the exact location.\n***\n### What to Bring and Wear\nBring a swimsuit and towel, and wear comfortable summer clothing. Covered walking shoes are recommended.\n***\n### Cancellation Policy\nMinimum 24 hours notice for groups of 1-5, 48 hours notice for groups of 6 or more, and 72 hour notice for private groups to receive a full refund.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "**Things to Bring and Wear**\n\nPlease bring a swimsuit, towels, and water shoes if you would like to swim in the private waterfall. Wear comfortable summer clothing and bring a rain jacket. Covered walking shoes are recommended.\n\n**Included in the Tour**\n\nLocal style picnic lunch consists of teriyaki chicken, fish, sweet potato, and steamed rice with assorted juices, snacks, and bottled water. In addition, all park entrance fees, mosquito repellent, and rain gear.\n\n**Not included in the tour**\n\nTour guide gratuities. Tipping is a great way to show appreciation for the hard work and dedication it takes to be a guide.\n\n\n**Look for our Mercedes van with Wasabi Tours Hawaii logo at your pickup location.**\n